QuestGuidance.Register("en",247,{
[7873]="7002F844\n1\tDefeat the Easterlings' leader at Olghakhósh\tThe leader of the Easterlings who led the assault on Wakenflood can be found in Olghakhósh, near the Anduin's edge. You should defeat the leader of the Easterlings.\n2\tTell Sergeant Hubyrt of your victory\tSergeant Hubyrt awaits your return at Wakenflood, where his men reel from a recent Easterling assault. You should return to Hubyrt with the news of our victory against the war-leader of Olghakhósh.\n",
[7874]="70000DB6\n1\tTalk to Rollo Boffin\tRollo Boffin is in Woodhall, east of Tuckborough on the Stock Road. Since Longo Burrows was unhelpful in learning Gerebert's location, Esilia asked you to speak with Rollo Boffin. Since Rollo oversees much of the pipe-weed that passes through Woodhall, and Gerebert hid on a waggon carrying leaf that was travelling to the east, he may know something about Gerebert.\n",
[7875]="70062616\n1\tStand near the Hobby Master in Lhan Garan and catch a fish\tMadog asked you to catch a fish while standing near the Hobby Master in Lhan Garan. Catch a fish.\n2\tTalk to Madog\t\n",
[7876]="70007018\n1\tCollect drake-leather hides\tDrakes can be found in the western valley of Ram Dúath, north of Esteldín. You should collect drake-wings from the pass of Ram Dúath.\n2\tCollect drake-leather hides (total: 4)\tDrakes can be found in the western valley of Ram Dúath, north of Esteldín. You should collect drake-wings from the pass of Ram Dúath.\n3\tBring the leathers to Melthindir\tMelthindir is at Esteldín, standing watch outside the east entrance. You should bring the leather you collected to Melthindir.\n",
[7877]="70054652\n1\tFind Faeron\tFaeron did not return to the Stargazers' Spire with the others, so he must still be somewhere in the Circle of Madness. You should find Faeron!\n2\tTalk to Rhadrog\tFaeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are in quick pursuit. You should return to the Barad Elenath and inform Rhadrog!\n3\tTalk to Dolenthol\tFaeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are hot on their heels! You should inform Dolenthol!\n4\tTalk to Rhadrog\tDolenthol is ready to help Faeron and Viznak. You should let Rhadrog know you are ready to go.\n5\tTalk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'\tViznak and Faeron need your help! You should talk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'.\n6\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak has survived the attack, and is now resting outside Barad Elenath. You should talk to Viznak.\n7\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron has returned to Barad Elenath, the Stargazers' Spire. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[7878]="70042914\n1\tTravel to Waymeet and speak with Bingo\tBingo has decided the first stop on his journey will be the meeting of the roads at Waymeet, east of Michel Delving.\n2\tReturn to Bingo's hobbit-hole and retrieve his walking-stick\tBingo left his walking-stick leaning against the side of his hobbit-hole, and asked you to run back and retrieve it.\n3\tFind Bingo in Bywater and give him his walking-stick\tBingo said he would continue on to Bywater while you retrieved his walking-stick.\n4\tTalk to Bingo in the Frogmoors\tThe swampy Frogmoors are east and north of Bywater. Bingo suggested a sneaky detour into the Frogmoors to evade the nosey hobbits hounding his steps.\n5\tDefeat wild hill-toads in the Frogmoors (total: 4)\tBingo is terrified of frogs and toads, and has asked you to defeat enough of the wild hill-toads that plague the Frogmoors so he can return to the road.\n6\tTalk to Bingo in the Frogmoors\tWhen last you saw Bingo, he was paralyzed with fear in the western reaches of the Frogmoors.\n7\tReturn to Bingo's hobbit-hole and retrieve his other satchel\tBingo said he forgot his other satchel and asked you to return to his hobbit-hole to retrieve it.\n8\tFind Bingo on the outskirts of Budgeford and give him his other satchel\tBingo said he would meet you on the outskirts of Budgeford once you retrieved the other satchel he accidentally left behind.\n",
[7879]="7000328A\n1\tTalk to Bregar\tBregar is at Duillond, north of Celondim. Toronn has asked you to try to convince Bregar to accompany him into the West.\n",
[7880]="700346BF\n1\tGrab the torch near the Orc tents closest to the road\tThe Orcs have set up their camp in the fields of Edsig's Farm while they convert the farm into an Orc outpost. The tents are made of a material that looks like it should burn easily....\n2\tGrab the torch near the Orc tents closest to the road\tIn the group of tents closest to the road, there seems to be a torch left by the fire. That torch will make quick work of these tents.\n3\tThe group of tents closest to the road should be reduced to smouldering ash. These tents are near where you picked up the torch, and are in the south-east corner of Edsig's Farm.\t\n4\tThe group of tents closest to the windmill should be burned to the ground. These tents are on the northern side of Edsig's Farm.\t\n5\tThe group of tents closest to the barn should be reduced to ash. These tents are in the south-west corner of Edsig's Farm.\t\n6\tCompleted\tYou have burned down the last of the Orcs' tents at Edsig's Farm.\n",
[7881]="70016B20\n1\tTalk to Svanr in Nud-melek\tThe dwarf Svanr can be found upon the western stair of Nud-melek, atop Khadar-zarâm. You should speak with Svanr.\n",
[7882]="70033330\n1\tDestroy the carts (total: 8)\tThe mine carts are in Nud-melek at the northern cross-roads of Sudulthurkh. Mazog's forces are dragging mining-carts filled with supplies through Nud-melek.\n2\tTell Svanr what you found\tSvanr can be found near Sudulthurkh in northern Nud-melek. You should tell Svanr that you have destroyed several carts of the goblins in Nud-melek, hindering their exit from the mines.\n",
[7883]="7004A8FF\n1\tDefeat voracious leeches (total: 10)\tVoracious leeches can be found in the waters of Dath Nethryn. You should defeat voracious leeches.\n",
[7884]="70037E5A\n1\tFind the missing sword\tTéothic's sword may be found in the hills east of Aldburg. Téothic has asked you to recover his sword, an old family heirloom, which was dropped by the hunter that he hired.\n2\tTalk to Téothic\tTéothic is in Aldburg, to the west of the hills. You found Téothic's heirloom sword and should return it to him at once.\n",
[7885]="70037AD8\n1\tBoard up homes in Entwade with wood planks (total: 6)\tPlanks can be found outside several homes in Entwade. Gifel has asked that you take some of the pressure off of Edric's men by boarding up some of the houses.\n2\tTalk to Gifel\tGifel can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade at one of the tables. You have finished boarding up the homes of Entwade, and should now return to Gifel.\n",
[7886]="700571B1\n1\tEstablish an encampment in Misthallow near Framsburg\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should establish the camp of Hlithseld with Léothred.\n2\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n3\tExplore Framsburg\tFramsburg can be found in the north of Misthallow. You should explore Framsburg.\n4\tTalk to Léothred in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n5\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n6\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n7\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n8\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n9\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n10\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n11\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n12\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n13\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n14\tTalk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg\tLéothred can be found in Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.\n15\tLearn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred\tFramsburg can be found in Misthallow. You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.\n16\tTravel to Hlithseld to rest\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should travel to Hlithseld and rest.\n17\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tHlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n",
[7887]="70041A51\n1\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin. Nimithil has asked you to accompany her in speaking to the Steward of Ost Anglebed of her worries about the Heirs of Castamir and their influence on her people.\n2\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin. You have survived Malthellim's betrayal and should now speak to Nimithil about what is to be done next.\n",
[7888]="70057189\n1\tFind evidence that the mearas still exist\tEvidence that the mearas still exist may be nearby in Misthallow. You should search for evidence that the mearas still exist.\n2\tFollow fresh hoofprints\030Examine the hoofprints\tThe hoofprints may lead to a mearh. You should follow the hoofprints.\n3\tTalk to Léothred at Thokvist\tLéothred can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Léothred.\n4\tSeek out the mearh that Léothred saw in the mist\tLéothred thought he saw a mearh near to Thokvist in Misthallow. You should go to that location and see if you can find the mearh.\n5\tTalk to Léothred at Thokvist\tLéothred can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
